    // started converging distant surfaces onto this band rather than onto the\r
    // cool dome above it. The residual warmth it left was invisible while it was\r
    // a thin strip mostly hidden behind terrain; with the far field dissolving\r
    // *into* it, it became a tan wash across a quarter of the frame, on the side\r
