    // and the noise is effectively one-dimensional, so the holes come out as a\r
    // row of vertical slots — a comb, not a breakup.\r
    // 0.72 rather than 0.5 because gradient noise only reaches about +/-0.7, and\r
    // a threshold that never sees the ends of the range erodes evenly instead of\r
    // tearing.\r
    //\r
