    //\r
    // Per-term, because "the wall is the wrong colour" is not a question any\r
    // amount of staring at the composite can answer. Each mode returns one term\r
    // in the same radiance units the beauty pass works in, so the tonemapper\r
    // shows them at the exposure they actually contribute at, and two of them\r
    // side by side say immediately which one is carrying the hue.\r
    //\r
