// Temporal anti-aliasing.\r
//\r
// The one post-process this content genuinely cannot do without. The snow\r
// material's whole detail budget is spent on\r
// things that live at or below the pixel: two octaves of discrete crystal glints,\r
// three tiled grain scales, sastrugi at a decimetre, a rotated Poisson shadow\r
// filter dithered per pixel, and a plume of two-centimetre grains. Every one of\r
